MORET_BEGIN
GODIVA perturbation MORET 5 VARD
* Hypothese : H32b densite relative MORET 5 (VARD 0.01 -0.01)
* Attendu    : MORET 5 : NORMAL END, dkeff densite +1 pct proche de celui de ok_pert_dens_repl (MORET 6)

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 SPHE 8.7407
    VOLU 1 0 1 m1 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
    COMP UMET_P1
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.54488E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
    COMP UMET_P2
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.45488E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
  ENDM



ASSO
  PERT 2
    MEDI m1 UMET
      VARD 0.01 -0.01
ENDA

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 100
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
